From db6ff91c7ef2df2ab795a2883d6b524a49e50d16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 18:00:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Discord welcome message for new servers and members

Adds a shared welcome embed (buildWelcomeEmbed in src/welcomeMessage.ts)
covering what Double Helix is, session/permission basics, and a docs
link placeholder.

Wires it into two events in src/index.ts:
- guildCreate: posts it to the server's system channel (falling back to
  the first postable text channel) when the bot joins a new server.
- guildMemberAdd: DMs it to each new human member who joins a server
  the bot is in (best-effort; DM failures are caught and logged).

Requires enabling the privileged "Server Members Intent" for this bot
in the Discord Developer Portal, since guildMemberAdd needs
GatewayIntentBits.GuildMembers.

Also fixes tsconfig.json: it had no "include", so tsc was pulling in
stray .ts files from the vendored superpowers/ dependency and failing
outside rootDir. Scoped it to src/ so `pnpm run build` actually works.

